B.a82=s(["Sign up and choose 'Mechanic'.","Fill in your profile: name, experience, services, whether you are mobile or work from a shop, and your warranty if you offer one.","Add your base address (see 'Your base address and how matching works').","Upload any ASE certificates and proof of insurance you have. These are optional but show as badges that help customers choose you.","Set up Stripe so you can be paid (see 'Getting paid: Stripe setup').","Read and sign the Mechanic Agreement."],t.s)
B.a_i=new A.hj(B.a82)
B.Zo=new A.b_("You can bid once YCYC has reviewed and verified your profile. Shops show 'awaiting verification' until that happens.")
B.a4X=s([B.a_i,B.Zo],t.f)
B.Xa=new A.bb("m-start-setup","Setting up your mechanic profile","Sign up, fill in your profile, and get verified.",B.a4X)
B.Zd=new A.b_("YCYC asks where you work from so it can match you with customers near you. When a customer posts a job, the app sends it to mechanics whose base address is within about 100 miles of the job.")
B.a8a=s(["Your base address is used only for matching. Customers do not see it.","Update it in your profile whenever you move your base.","If you have not saved a base address, you will see a reminder and you may see all open jobs instead of just nearby ones. You may also miss new-job notifications, so please add it."],t.s)
B.Xt=new A.ds(B.a8a)
B.a7_=s([B.Zd,B.Xt],t.f)
B.WP=new A.bb("m-start-base","Your base address and how matching works","Why we ask for it, and who sees it.",B.a7_)
B.ZT=new A.b_("Payouts go through Stripe. From your dashboard, tap to set up payouts and follow Stripe's steps. Stripe asks for identity and bank details directly. YCYC never sees your bank or card numbers.")
B.YI=new A.b_("Until Stripe finishes verifying you, you may not be able to be paid. Check your earnings screen for any item Stripe still needs.")
B.Yt=new A.dV("If Stripe asks for more information later, complete it promptly. Payouts can pause until you do.")
B.a68=s([B.ZT,B.YI,B.Yt],t.f)
B.VZ=new A.bb("m-start-stripe","Getting paid: Stripe setup","Connect a bank account or debit card through Stripe.",B.a68)
B.Z4=new A.b_("Upload ASE certificates and proof of insurance in your profile. YCYC reviews them. Approved ones show as badges on your profile and bids.")
B.a8g=s(["Only upload documents that are yours and current.","An insurance badge may disappear when the policy expires. Re-upload the new one.","Never fake or alter a document. It is grounds for permanent removal."],t.s)
B.Xv=new A.ds(B.a8g)
B.a9E=s([B.Z4,B.Xv],t.f)
B.Wl=new A.bb("m-start-badges","Certifications, insurance and your profile badges","Help customers trust you with real documents.",B.a9E)
B.ZR=new A.b_("Open jobs near you appear on your Jobs tab. When a new job is posted near you, you get a notification ('New job near you', or 'New diagnostic request near you'). Tap it to go straight to the job.")
B.Z6=new A.b_("Each job shows the vehicle, the problem description, photos, the zip code, and any flags (see 'Flags & labels' for what they all mean).")
B.Y3=new A.dV("The customer's full address is not shown while you are bidding.")
B.a8i=s([B.ZR,B.Z6,B.Y3],t.f)
B.W0=new A.bb("m-start-find","Finding jobs","The Jobs tab, notifications, and filters.",B.a8i)
B.a9R=s(["Open the job and read it carefully, including the flags and photos.","Tap to bid, enter your price and when you can arrive.","Add a note: what is included, parts or no parts, and anything the customer should know.","Submit. You can see your bid on your Bids tab."],t.s)
B.a_h=new A.hj(B.a9R)
B.YV=new A.b_("Read 'Bidding rules' before bidding. Honest, complete bids win repeat customers and protect your account.")
B.a5X=s([B.a_h,B.YV],t.f)
B.WR=new A.bb("m-start-bid","Submitting a bid","Price, arrival time, and a short note.",B.a5X)
B.ZA=new A.b_("When a customer accepts your bid and pays, their card is held. The job moves to 'In progress'. The customer's full address is then shown to you, along with the arrival time.")
B.Zt=new A.b_("The money is not paid out yet. It is released after the customer confirms the work is complete, or when YCYC releases it as the agreement describes.")
B.aan=s([B.ZA,B.Zt],t.f)
B.WD=new A.bb("m-start-won","After your bid is accepted","The customer pays into a hold. Then you do the work.",B.aan)
B.aaI=s(["Tap 'Heading to customer' when you set off, or 'Heading to parts store' if you are collecting parts first.","Tap 'I've arrived' (it checks your location) when you reach the address. The app records your location to check you are really there.","Ask the customer to confirm arrival and start of work, then tap 'Confirm arrived & started work' on your side too.","Do the work and send updates and photos in the app."],t.s)
B.a_g=new A.hj(B.aaI)
B.a_J=new A.hE("You must have a verified arrival before you can cancel for a customer-fault reason such as a no-show or wrong parts.")
B.Ye=new A.dV("Fees for rescheduling and cancelling depend on these check-ins. Check in honestly and on time.")
B.a6y=s([B.a_g,B.a_J,B.Ye],t.f)
B.Wq=new A.bb("m-start-checkin","Heading to the customer, arriving, and location check-ins","These records protect you and the customer.",B.a6y)
B.YM=new A.b_("If you find something else that needs doing, tap 'Propose additional work' in the app with a description, a price and optionally photos. The customer approves or declines. Never start extra work, or ask for extra money, before approval.")
B.Ya=new A.dV("You cannot add work to a diagnostic job. Hours and price are final once the diagnostic is accepted.")
B.a9O=s([B.YM,B.Ya],t.f)
B.VW=new A.bb("m-start-extra","Requesting additional work","Found something else? Ask in the app.",B.a9O)
B.YN=new A.b_("On a diagnostic job you bid a number of hours and your hourly rate. The customer sees the hours, the rate and the total. Once accepted, they are final.")
B.a7Q=s(["You must send a written diagnosis in the app ('Write & send diagnosis'): what you found, what you recommend, and whether the car is safe to drive.","Payment is released after you send it and the customer confirms you finished diagnosing.","If you cannot find the problem, say so honestly in the diagnosis.","Any repair the diagnosis suggests is a new job the customer can give to anyone."],t.s)
B.Xw=new A.ds(B.a7Q)
B.a6Z=s([B.YN,B.Xw],t.f)
B.Wy=new A.bb("m-start-diag","Diagnostic jobs","Bid hours and rate. Send a written diagnosis to be paid.",B.a6Z)
B.aaM=s(["Finish the work and tell the customer what was done.","Tap 'Work completed' in the app, and add notes and photos.","The customer reviews and releases payment. You are notified.","The customer may leave a review. Good work and clear communication earn good reviews."],t.s)
B.a_b=new A.hj(B.aaM)
B.aal=s([B.a_b],t.f)
B.X6=new A.bb("m-start-finish","Finishing the job and getting reviewed","Mark complete; the customer confirms; you are paid.",B.aal)
