B.a10=new A.ae(62251,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
B.a_K=new A.hE("Submitting a fraudulently low price is not allowed. It is grounds for removal.")
B.Zn=new A.b_("A bid is a promise. Bid the real price you will do the job for, including everything you expect the job to need.")
B.Zm=new A.b_("Not allowed:")
B.a60=s(["A price you do not intend to honor, to win the job and then raise it after arrival.","Bait-and-switch: a low bid followed by demands for more money, or refusing the agreed work unless the customer pays more.","Leaving out what you know the job needs, then adding it later outside the approval flow.","Bidding on a job you cannot or do not intend to do.","Bidding on a labor-only job and then requiring the customer to buy parts from you, or the reverse.","Asking the customer to pay cash, or to pay anywhere outside YCYC."],t.s)
B.Xy=new A.ds(B.a60)
B.Yy=new A.b_("What you can do: if the job turns out to need more than expected, send an additional work request in the app and let the customer decide. If it is far outside what was posted, it is fine to explain and let the customer cancel.")
B.Y6=new A.dV("Repeated complaints, cancelled jobs after low bids, or customers reporting a price change can lead to your account being reviewed, payouts held, suspension or permanent removal.")
B.a7a=s([B.a_K,B.Zn,B.Zm,B.Xy,B.Yy,B.Y6],t.f)
B.Wk=new A.bb("m-bidding-honest","Honest bidding: no fraudulent or bait prices","Bid what you will actually do the job for.",B.a7a)
B.ZE=new A.b_("If the customer switched on 'I have my own parts', the job carries a bold orange flag: LABOR QUOTE ONLY, CUSTOMER SUPPLYING PARTS. Bid labor only. Do not include parts in the price and do not bring parts.")
B.aa0=s(["Ask the customer for the part numbers if you want to check them before you go.","On arrival, check the parts are the right ones and are ready.","If the parts are wrong, take a clear photo of the part, then you can cancel for customer fault (a note of at least 10 characters is required). You receive 20% of the job price, shared as described in 'How payouts work'.","If the parts are not ready or nobody is there after you have waited 10 minutes, you can cancel the same way."],t.s)
B.Xl=new A.ds(B.aa0)
B.a_O=new A.hE("Only cancel for these reasons if they are true. You must have a verified arrival, and the photo and note are kept as evidence.")
B.a6U=s([B.ZE,B.Xl,B.a_O],t.f)
B.W2=new A.bb("m-bidding-laboronly","Labor-only jobs: how to bid","The customer supplies the parts. Quote labor only.",B.a6U)
B.Yw=new A.b_("Bid the realistic hours the diagnosis takes and your honest hourly rate. Once accepted, the hours and price are fixed. You cannot add time later.")
B.ZW=new A.b_("Be clear in your note about what is included, for example scan, inspection or test drive.")
B.aaF=s([B.Yw,B.ZW],t.f)
B.WJ=new A.bb("m-bidding-diag","Bidding on diagnostics","Hours x rate. No add-ons.",B.aaF)
B.Zb=new A.b_("All payments for jobs found on YCYC must go through YCYC. Do not accept or ask for cash, transfers or payment apps for a job that came from the platform, and do not take the customer off the platform to avoid fees.")
B.YE=new A.b_("This protects both of you: it keeps a record, and it keeps your payment secured. Breaking this rule can lead to removal and held payouts.")
B.a8y=s([B.Zb,B.YE],t.f)
B.WH=new A.bb("m-bidding-offapp","Keep everything on YCYC","No cash, no side deals.",B.a8y)
B.aa3=s(["Bid only on work you are qualified and equipped to do safely.","Check that you can make the arrival time you promise.","You are responsible for any licenses, permits and insurance your work needs.","If you cannot do the job after all, tell the customer and cancel early, before they are inconvenienced."],t.s)
B.Xn=new A.ds(B.aa3)
B.a7w=s([B.Xn],t.f)
B.Wa=new A.bb("m-bidding-only","Only bid on what you can do","Skill, tools, time, and licensing.",B.a7w)
B.a6E=s([B.Wk,B.W2,B.WJ,B.WH,B.Wa],t.fm)
B.a_y=new A.h5("Bidding rules","Honest bids only",B.a10,B.a6E)
B.a8m=s(["Clear description: a good job lists symptoms, when it started and what has been tried. Photos help.","Matches your skills, tools and parts access.","Distance and timing make sense. Check the zip code and travel time.","Price is realistic. You can do it safely and still earn a fair rate after YCYC's 15% fee.","Check the flags: Labor quote only, diagnostic needed, Dealer quote, and so on.","Does the vehicle look suitable for a mobile job? Heavy work may need a shop."],t.s)
B.Xs=new A.ds(B.a8m)
B.Yi=new A.dV("If a job is vague, bid a diagnostic first or say clearly in your note what is included.")
B.a6M=s([B.Xs,B.Yi],t.f)
B.Wg=new A.bb("m-choose-job","How to choose a good job","A quick checklist before you bid.",B.a6M)
B.Ze=new A.b_("On each job you see a customer label: either a rating like '4.8 (12 reviews)' or 'New customer'.")
B.aaU=s(["A good rating from several mechanics is a good sign.","A new customer is not a bad sign. Everyone starts somewhere. Be clear and keep everything in the app.","Customers who describe the problem clearly and respond quickly are usually easier to work with.","Be careful with anyone who wants cash, off-app payment or work before approval."],t.s)
B.XI=new A.ds(B.aaU)
B.Y7=new A.dV("YCYC cannot guarantee any customer. Use your judgment, and keep your own safety first.")
B.a6N=s([B.Ze,B.XI,B.Y7],t.f)
B.X_=new A.bb("m-choose-customer","How to choose a good customer","Use the label on the job and your own judgment.",B.a6N)
B.a7G=s(["A request to pay or be paid outside the app.","Pressure to start before the payment hold is in place.","A job description that does not match the photos.","A customer who will not give clear access or contact.","Unrealistic expectations on price or time.","Parts supplied that look wrong for the vehicle (check part numbers)."],t.s)
B.XA=new A.ds(B.a7G)
B.ZU=new A.b_("If something feels wrong, you can decline to bid, or cancel before work starts. If you feel unsafe, leave and report it.")
B.a5R=s([B.XA,B.ZU],t.f)
B.WY=new A.bb("m-choose-red","Red flags to watch for","Walk away or ask questions.",B.a5R)
B.a8s=s([B.Wg,B.X_,B.WY],t.fm)
B.a_t=new A.h5("Choosing jobs & customers","Pick good work. Spot bad ones early.",B.jE,B.a8s)
B.YF=new A.b_("YCYC charges mechanics 15% of the job price. The customer pays the job price plus their own 5% service fee on top, which does not come out of your share.")
B.Z7=new A.b_("Example: a 200 dollar job. The fee is 30 dollars, you receive 170 dollars. The customer pays 210 dollars (200 plus their 10 dollar fee).")
B.ZX=new A.b_("Approved additional work follows the same rule.")
B.a6I=s([B.YF,B.Z7,B.ZX],t.f)
B.X2=new A.bb("m-payouts-fee","The 15% fee","YCYC keeps 15% of the job price. You keep the rest.",B.a6I)
B.a7B=s(["The customer's card is held when they accept your bid and pay.","After the work is done, the customer confirms and releases payment. The money is captured.","Your share goes to your Stripe account. Stripe then pays out to your bank or debit card on your payout schedule."],t.s)
B.a_c=new A.hj(B.a7B)
B.ZK=new A.b_("Bank timing is set by Stripe and your bank, usually a few business days. Check your Earnings screen for the status of each job.")
B.Ys=new A.dV("If a customer neither confirms nor reports a problem, the hold can be released to you automatically before the card authorization expires (often about seven days).")
B.a7o=s([B.a_c,B.ZK,B.Ys],t.f)
B.VR=new A.bb("m-payouts-timing","When you get paid","Hold, capture, then Stripe pays you.",B.a7o)
B.Zx=new A.b_("If you have an eligible debit card on Stripe, you can cash out available funds instantly. The fee is 3% of the amount cashed out, with a minimum of 1 dollar. The exact fee and what you will receive are shown in the app before you confirm. Standard payouts to your bank on Stripe's normal schedule have no instant cash-out fee.")
B.Yj=new A.dV("Eligibility depends on Stripe and your card. Not all cards support instant payouts.")
B.a7e=s([B.Zx,B.Yj],t.f)
B.W8=new A.bb("m-payouts-instant","Instant cash-out","Get paid in minutes for a small fee.",B.a7e)
B.a9g=s(["Customer cancels after paying, before work started: 20% of the amount held is the cancellation fee. YCYC takes its usual share and you receive the rest.","Customer cancels after work started: 50% fee, shared the same way.","Customer-fault cancellation by you (wrong parts, parts not ready, or the customer not there or not responding 10 minutes after your arrival): 20% of the job price, of which YCYC keeps 5% and you receive 15%.","Reschedule approved by you: 20% (you have arrived), 10% (you are on the way), 5% (not set off) of the job price. YCYC keeps its 5% in the arrival and on-the-way cases.","You cancel, or you do not show up: no fee, and the customer is not charged."],t.s)
B.Xr=new A.ds(B.a9g)
B.a5x=s([B.Xr],t.f)
B.X9=new A.bb("m-payouts-cancel","Payouts when a job is cancelled or rescheduled","Who gets what.",B.a5x)
B.Zu=new A.b_("If YCYC decides after review to refund a customer in full or part, the refunded amount is not paid to you, or may be recovered from your future payouts if it was already paid. A bank dispute that the customer wins has the same effect.")
B.Zc=new A.b_("Good records protect you: photos, notes, check-ins and the customer's confirmation.")
B.aaN=s([B.Zu,B.Zc],t.f)
B.VV=new A.bb("m-payouts-refunds","Refunds and reversals","What happens if the customer is refunded or disputes.",B.aaN)
B.Z0=new A.b_("You are responsible for your own taxes. Stripe may send you tax forms such as a 1099 if you meet the thresholds. Keep your own records of your income.")
B.Yd=new A.dV("YCYC cannot give tax advice. Talk to a tax professional.")
B.a70=s([B.Z0,B.Yd],t.f)
B.Wr=new A.bb("m-payouts-tax","Taxes","You are an independent contractor.",B.a70)
B.ZO=new A.b_("The Earnings screen lists your jobs with amounts, YCYC's fee, and the status of each payout. Use it to check what is pending, what has been paid, and what Stripe still needs from you.")
B.a7y=s([B.ZO],t.f)
