B.Zr=new A.b_("Open the app, tap 'Don't have an account? Sign up', enter your email and a password, and choose 'Customer' under 'I am a...'. Then tap 'Create account'.")
B.Zs=new A.b_("The first time you sign in you will be asked to read and sign the Customer Agreement. It explains fees, cancellations, holds, refunds and your privacy, so it is worth a read.")
B.Y5=new A.dV("You do not choose a city. The address you give when you post a job is how YCYC finds mechanics near you.")
