B.WV=new A.bb("c-start-account","Creating your account","Sign up, choose Customer, and you are ready to post.",B.aaP)
B.aa2=s(["Tap to post a new job from your home screen.","Pick a saved vehicle, or add a new one (make, model, year).","Enter the service address: where the work will happen. YCYC uses it to send your job to mechanics within about 100 miles.","Describe the problem: noises, warning lights, when it started, anything you have already tried. More detail means better, more accurate bids.","Optional: add photos or a quote you already have from a shop.","Tap 'Post for bids'."],t.s)
B.a_d=new A.hj(B.aa2)
B.Y8=new A.dV("Mechanics only see your zip code while bidding. Your full address is shown only to the mechanic you choose, and only after your payment is secured.")
B.ZD=new A.b_("Posting is free. You can cancel for free until you accept a bid and pay.")
B.a9C=s([B.a_d,B.Y8,B.ZD],t.f)
B.W_=new A.bb("c-start-post","Posting a job","Vehicle, address, what is wrong, and photos.",B.a9C)
B.Zp=new A.b_("If you do not know what is wrong, post a diagnostic request instead of a repair. Mechanics bid a number of hours and their hourly rate, and you see the hours, the rate and the total.")
B.a9c=s(["Once you accept, the hours and price are final. The mechanic cannot add time or charges.","The mechanic must send you a written diagnosis through the app: what they found, what they recommend, and whether the car can be driven.","Payment is released only after the diagnosis is sent and you confirm in the app that the mechanic finished diagnosing.","If the mechanic does not find the problem or does not send the written diagnosis, they are not entitled to payment and YCYC may refund you in full."],t.s)
B.Xh=new A.ds(B.a9c)
B.Ym=new A.dV("Any repair the diagnosis recommends is a separate job. You can hire any mechanic for it, including the one who diagnosed it, or none.")
B.a8E=s([B.Zp,B.Xh,B.Ym],t.f)
B.WT=new A.bb("c-start-diagnostic","Not sure what is wrong? Ask for a diagnostic","Pay a mechanic to find the problem first, then decide on the repair.",B.a8E)
B.ZZ=new A.b_("Bids appear on your job as mechanics send them. Only you can see them; mechanics cannot see each other's prices.")
B.YG=new A.b_("Tap a mechanic's card to open their profile: reviews, years of experience, certifications, whether they carry insurance, mobile or shop, warranty, and more.")
B.Zj=new A.b_("There is no rush. A low price is not the only thing that matters. See 'Choosing a mechanic' for tips.")
B.a7m=s([B.ZZ,B.YG,B.Zj],t.f)
B.WG=new A.bb("c-start-bids","Reading and comparing bids","Price, arrival time, and the mechanic profile.",B.a7m)
B.aae=s(["Open the bid you like and tap 'Accept & pay'.","Review the total. It is the job price plus YCYC's 5% service fee, shown before you confirm.","Pay securely through Stripe. Your card details never touch YCYC's servers."],t.s)
B.a_9=new A.hj(B.aae)
B.Za=new A.b_("Your card is authorized: the money is set aside (it may show as pending on your statement) but it is not paid to the mechanic until you confirm the job is complete, or YCYC releases it as described in the Customer Agreement.")
B.Zy=new A.b_("If you leave the payment screen before finishing, your job shows 'Payment needed to confirm this job'. Tap 'Return to payment' to continue. If you do not want to go ahead, you can still cancel for free.")
B.a6R=s([B.a_9,B.Za,B.Zy],t.f)
B.Wc=new A.bb("c-start-accept","Accepting a bid and paying","Your card is held, not charged, until the work is done.",B.a6R)
B.Yv=new A.b_("Your mechanic taps 'Heading to customer' (or 'Heading to parts store') when they set off and 'I've arrived' when they get there. The app records their location at those moments to check they really came to your address.")
B.a9I=s(["Tap 'Track mechanic' to watch their trip on a map when they are sharing it.","Tap 'Ask your mechanic to share location' if you would like to see where they are.","When they arrive, tap 'Confirm mechanic arrived & started work'. Only confirm what is true."],t.s)
B.XC=new A.ds(B.a9I)
B.Yn=new A.dV("The arrival and start-of-work confirmations matter for cancellation fees. Before both of you have confirmed that work started, a cancellation fee is 20%. After, it is 50%.")
B.a9m=s([B.Yv,B.XC,B.Yn],t.f)
B.WO=new A.bb("c-start-track","Following your mechanic and confirming arrival","Heading to you, Track mechanic, and the arrival confirmation.",B.a9m)
B.ZV=new A.b_("If your mechanic finds something else that needs fixing, they send a request in the app with a description, a price and optionally photos. You approve or decline each request. Nothing is added to your bill unless you approve it.")
B.a_5=new A.b_("Approved extra work is paid for the same way as the main job: held first, released when you confirm.")
B.a_F=new A.hE("Do not agree to extra work or extra payment outside the app. If a mechanic asks for more money in person, ask them to send it as an additional work request, or tell us.")
B.Yo=new A.dV("Diagnostic jobs are different: the hours and price are final, so mechanics cannot add work to a diagnostic.")
B.a9w=s([B.ZV,B.a_5,B.a_F,B.Yo],t.f)
B.Ws=new A.bb("c-start-extra","Approving additional work","Your mechanic finds more work; you decide.",B.a9w)
B.YL=new A.b_("When the mechanic says the work is done, you will be notified. Check the work and the car.")
B.a5P=s(["If everything is right, tap 'Review & release payment' and follow the steps to confirm and sign.","Your held payment is then captured and paid out to the mechanic.","Tap 'Leave a review' to rate the mechanic. Honest reviews help other customers."],t.s)
B.a_8=new A.hj(B.a5P)
B.a_I=new A.hE("Report any problem BEFORE you release payment. Once you confirm, the money is paid out. If a job is never confirmed or reported, the hold can be released to the mechanic automatically before your card authorization expires (often about seven days).")
B.a7n=s([B.YL,B.a_8,B.a_I],t.f)
B.X5=new A.bb("c-start-finish","Finishing up: release payment and leave a review","Check the work first. Report problems before you release.",B.a7n)
B.Z5=new A.b_("If you already have the parts, switch on 'I have my own parts' on the post-job screen. Mechanics then see a bold flag, 'LABOR QUOTE ONLY, CUSTOMER SUPPLYING PARTS', and bid for labor only. They will not bring parts.")
B.YH=new A.b_("When you post, you will be asked to confirm: 'Please be sure your parts are the correct parts for this car.' Tick the box to continue.")
B.a_Q=new A.hE("You are responsible for the parts being the right ones for your vehicle and ready when the mechanic arrives. If the mechanic arrives and the parts are wrong or not ready, or nobody is there to meet them, the mechanic can cancel and you are charged a fee of 20% of the job price. For wrong parts the mechanic must attach a photo of the part, which you can see on the job.")
B.Yc=new A.dV("Not sure a part fits? Check the part number against your vehicle's year, engine and trim before you post, or ask the seller. You can also post a normal job and let the mechanic supply the parts.")
B.a8K=s([B.Z5,B.YH,B.a_Q,B.Yc],t.f)
B.X0=new A.bb("c-start-ownparts","Using your own parts (labor-only quote)","Switch on I have my own parts and mechanics quote labor only.",B.a8K)
B.YQ=new A.b_("Settings > My Garage keeps your saved vehicles so you can pick one when posting. Settings > My Address keeps the address where work happens.")
B.Yz=new A.b_("The address is shown to a mechanic only after you accept their bid and your payment is secured, and it is hidden again once the job is done.")
B.aaq=s([B.YQ,B.Yz],t.f)
B.VT=new A.bb("c-start-garage","Your garage and your address","Save vehicles and your address once.",B.aaq)
B.a9N=s([B.WV,B.W_,B.WT,B.WG,B.Wc,B.WO,B.Ws,B.X5,B.X0,B.VT],t.fm)
B.a_u=new A.h5("How to use the app","From posting a job to paying and reviewing",B.y9,B.a9N)
B.Z3=new A.b_("After you have paid, tap 'Reschedule this job', pick a new date and time, and send the request. Your mechanic must approve the new time.")
B.YD=new A.b_("The fee depends on what your mechanic has already done, as shown by their location check-ins:")
B.a7Z=s(["Mechanic has arrived at your address: 20% of the job price.","Mechanic is on the way (including to a parts store) but has not arrived: 10%.","Mechanic has not set off yet: 5%."],t.s)
B.XJ=new A.ds(B.a7Z)
B.YK=new A.b_("The fee is charged only if the mechanic approves. It is taken from your payment hold, the rest of the hold is released back to your card, and you pay again to confirm the new time. If the mechanic declines, the job is cancelled and you are not charged.")
B.Yb=new A.dV("A job can be rescheduled up to three times. You cannot reschedule once you and the mechanic have both confirmed that work started.")
B.a5Z=s([B.Z3,B.YD,B.XJ,B.YK,B.Yb],t.f)
B.Wx=new A.bb("c-changes-reschedule","Rescheduling a job","Ask for a new time. The fee depends on where your mechanic is.",B.a5Z)
B.a9q=s(["Before you pay: cancel for free.","After you pay, before you and the mechanic have both confirmed work started: 20% of the amount held.","After you both confirmed work started: 50%."],t.s)
B.Xm=new A.ds(B.a9q)
B.YC=new A.b_("The rest of your hold is released back to your card. The fee goes to the mechanic for their time, and YCYC keeps its usual share of it.")
B.YZ=new A.b_("If you are cancelling because you felt unsafe, the mechanic asked you to pay outside YCYC, or the mechanic changed the price or refused the agreed work, choose that reason. The job is paused and YCYC reviews it before any money moves, instead of the fees being applied automatically.")
B.Yh=new A.dV("If your mechanic never shows up, as shown by their location check-ins after a short grace period past the scheduled time, you are not charged.")
B.a6r=s([B.Xm,B.YC,B.YZ,B.Yh],t.f)
B.W7=new A.bb("c-changes-cancel","Cancelling a job and cancellation fees","Free before you pay; a fee after.",B.a6r)
B.ZI=new A.b_("If your mechanic cancels, you are not charged and any hold is released.")
B.ZQ=new A.b_("The exception is a labor-only job (you supplied the parts). If the mechanic has arrived at your address and the parts are wrong or not ready, or you were not there, they can cancel and you are charged 20% of the job price. They must tell you what happened, and for wrong parts they must attach a photo.")
B.Z2=new A.b_("If you think a charge like that is wrong, tap 'Report a concern' on the job and tell us what happened.")
B.aaK=s([B.ZI,B.ZQ,B.Z2],t.f)
B.Wp=new A.bb("c-changes-mechcancel","If your mechanic cancels","Usually you are not charged. One exception.",B.aaK)
B.a7M=s([B.Wx,B.W7,B.Wp],t.fm)
B.a_v=new A.h5("Rescheduling & cancelling","What it costs and how it works",B.me,B.a7M)
B.a7p=s(["Open the job and tap 'Track mechanic' to see whether they are on the way.","Tap 'Ask your mechanic to share location'. They get a notification asking them to turn sharing on.","Give a reasonable wait. Delays happen. The app has no chat or phone feature, so you cannot message the mechanic from inside it.","If they truly never arrive, cancel the job and choose 'The mechanic didn't show up'. We check their location record. If it shows they never arrived, you are not charged and they are not paid."],t.s)
B.a_l=new A.hj(B.a7p)
B.Y4=new A.dV("You can report a no-show only 30 minutes after the scheduled arrival time. If your mechanic's bid had no time of day, it is about 3 hours after your payment was secured.")
B.Zi=new A.b_("A mechanic who arrives late is not a no-show. You can let the job go ahead, or cancel; a normal cancellation fee applies if you cancel after paying. If you are unhappy about repeated lateness, tell us with 'Report a concern' and leave an honest review.")
B.aag=s([B.a_l,B.Y4,B.Zi],t.f)
B.WB=new A.bb("c-incase-late","My mechanic is late or did not show up","Check Track mechanic, wait a little, then use the no-show option.",B.aag)
B.ZL=new A.b_("Paying outside YCYC removes your payment protection and the record of what was agreed. It also breaks the mechanic's agreement.")
B.a6g=s(["Politely decline and keep the payment in the app.","Cancel the job and choose 'The mechanic asked me to pay outside YCYC'. The job is paused for YCYC to review, and you are not charged while it is under review.","Tap 'Report a concern' to email us the details."],t.s)
B.a_e=new A.hj(B.a6g)
B.aaD=s([B.ZL,B.a_e],t.f)
B.X8=new A.bb("c-incase-offapp","My mechanic asked me to pay cash or outside the app","Say no and tell us.",B.aaD)
B.YY=new A.b_("The price you accepted is the price. If your mechanic finds more work, they must send an additional work request in the app, and you choose to approve or decline.")
B.Z1=new A.b_("If they refuse to do the agreed work unless you pay more, cancel with the reason 'The mechanic changed the price or refused the agreed work'. The job is paused for review before any money moves.")
B.Y2=new A.dV("On a diagnostic job the hours and price are final. The mechanic cannot add charges.")
B.a5a=s([B.YY,B.Z1,B.Y2],t.f)
B.VS=new A.bb("c-incase-price","My mechanic wants to change the price","Only the app can add to your bill.",B.a5a)
B.a86=s(["Do NOT tap 'Release payment'.","Take clear photos and notes of the problem, with the date.","Tap 'Report a concern' on the job and describe what is wrong.","Keep everything in the app, so there is a record."],t.s)
B.a_f=new A.hj(B.a86)
B.a_E=new A.hE("Once you confirm the job is complete, the held payment is paid out. Report problems before you confirm.")
B.Zl=new A.b_("See 'Refunds: how they work' and 'How YCYC reviews a problem' for what happens next.")
B.a8t=s([B.a_f,B.a_E,B.Zl],t.f)
B.WZ=new A.bb("c-incase-quality","The work is not right or not finished","Do not release payment. Report it first.",B.a8t)
B.a5_=s(["If the car is unsafe to drive, do not drive it.","Photograph the damage and the area, with dates, as soon as you notice it.","Do not release payment, and tap 'Report a concern' right away.","Your mechanic works for themselves, not for YCYC. Any warranty or insurance is between you and them. Ask them for their insurance details; a mechanic's profile may show an insurance badge, but it is not a guarantee."],t.s)
B.XH=new A.ds(B.a5_)
B.aam=s([B.XH],t.f)
B.Wt=new A.bb("c-incase-damage","I think my car was damaged","Safety first, then evidence.",B.aam)
B.ZY=new A.b_("If the mechanic arrives and your parts are the wrong ones, they can cancel. You are charged 20% of the job price, and the rest of your hold is released.")
B.YP=new A.b_("You can see what they wrote and the photo they took on the cancelled job. If you disagree, use 'Report a concern'.")
B.Yk=new A.dV("To avoid this, double-check part numbers against your vehicle (year, engine, trim) before the mechanic arrives, and have the parts ready.")
