B.a_A=new A.h5("What to do in case of...","Common situations, step by step",B.xZ,B.a7b)
B.Z9=new A.b_("YCYC is a technology platform. We do not perform, supervise or guarantee repair work, and the mechanics are independent businesses, not YCYC employees. The agreement for the repair is between you and the mechanic.")
B.Zg=new A.b_("Because of that, YCYC cannot endorse any specific mechanic or shop. Badges, verification and reviews are information to help you decide, not a guarantee of any outcome.")
B.a6V=s([B.Z9,B.Zg],t.f)
B.Wb=new A.bb("c-disputes-neutral","YCYC is a neutral platform","We connect you with independent mechanics. We do not do the repair.",B.a6V)
B.a_N=new A.hE("Refunds are not guaranteed. Because of the nature of repair services, a completed or partly completed repair generally cannot be undone, so refunds are treated strictly.")
B.Zq=new A.b_("If a refund is issued, it is at YCYC's sole discretion, based on the evidence provided by you and the mechanic and on the record in the app (photos, notes, location check-ins, confirmations and ratings).")
B.a9u=s(["A refund may be full, partial, or none, depending on what the evidence shows.","If the problem was YCYC's own error, YCYC refunds its fees.","If it was caused by you, YCYC may keep its service fee and may reduce a refund by payment-processing costs.","Cancellation and rescheduling fees follow the rules in the Customer Agreement and are not refunded as a courtesy."],t.s)
B.Xi=new A.ds(B.a9u)
B.Yr=new A.dV("Nothing here limits any right you have under the law or with your card issuer. See the Customer Agreement and the Terms of Service for the full terms.")
B.a9A=s([B.a_N,B.Zq,B.Xi,B.Yr],t.f)
B.Wf=new A.bb("c-disputes-refunds","Refunds: how they work","Refunds are not guaranteed. Decided case by case, based on evidence.",B.a9A)
B.a79=s(["Do not release payment while an issue is open.","Collect evidence: dated photos or video, the part or invoice if relevant, and notes of what was agreed and what happened.","Tap 'Report a concern' on the job, or email rayconsumerlabs@gmail.com, and describe: what you expected, what happened, and what you would like us to consider.","Reply promptly and truthfully if we ask questions."],t.s)
B.a_j=new A.hj(B.a79)
B.YR=new A.b_("Reporting a safety concern, a request to pay outside the app, or a price or scope disagreement pauses the job and the held payment while YCYC reviews it.")
B.a7c=s([B.a_j,B.YR],t.f)
B.VU=new A.bb("c-disputes-report","How to report a problem the right way","Report before you release payment, and keep it in the app.",B.a7c)
B.aa6=s(["Photos or video of the vehicle before and after, with dates.","The job description, the accepted bid, and any additional work requests, which are all recorded in the app.","The mechanic's progress notes and photos.","Location check-ins (heading to you / arrived), which the app records automatically.","Any invoice or written quote showing what was agreed.","A written opinion from another shop, if you got one."],t.s)
B.XE=new A.ds(B.aa6)
B.Yf=new A.dV("Evidence works best when it is specific. 'The brake pads were replaced but the rotors still have deep grooves (photo)' is easier to review than 'the work is bad'.")
B.a6O=s([B.XE,B.Yf],t.f)
B.WE=new A.bb("c-disputes-evidence","What evidence helps","Clear, dated, and in the app.",B.a6O)
B.YO=new A.b_("When a problem is reported, YCYC may freeze the job and the held payment while it reviews. We may look at photos, notes, check-ins, confirmations, ratings and anything else in the app's record, and we may ask both sides for more information.")
B.ZF=new A.b_("YCYC may decide, in its reasonable discretion, to release the payment to the mechanic, refund you in full, or split the payment, and may decide who was at fault. YCYC's decision controls how money held through the platform is paid out.")
B.Yg=new A.dV("We will notify you when there is a decision.")
B.a7x=s([B.YO,B.ZF,B.Yg],t.f)
B.Wm=new A.bb("c-disputes-review","How YCYC reviews a problem","The job and payment are paused while we look.",B.a7x)
B.a_2=new A.b_("If you think there is a problem with a charge, contact us first so we can investigate. You keep every right you have under the law to dispute a charge in good faith.")
B.a_P=new A.hE("Disputing a charge for work that was actually performed, or to avoid paying a legitimate amount, is a breach of the Customer Agreement and can lead to account suspension and recovery of amounts owed.")
B.a6v=s([B.a_2,B.a_P],t.f)
B.X7=new A.bb("c-disputes-chargeback","Please contact us before disputing a charge with your bank","We can often resolve it faster, and bad-faith disputes are a breach.",B.a6v)
B.Zz=new A.b_("Card authorizations last only a limited time, often about seven days. If, as yours is about to expire, the job has been neither confirmed nor reported as a problem, YCYC may release the payment to the mechanic automatically.")
B.Zf=new A.b_("If you have an issue, report it promptly so this does not happen while it is open.")
B.a9v=s([B.Zz,B.Zf],t.f)
B.WQ=new A.bb("c-disputes-auto","Automatic release of payment","Why you should confirm or report promptly.",B.a9v)
B.a7d=s([B.Wb,B.Wf,B.VU,B.WE,B.Wm,B.X7,B.WQ],t.fm)
B.a_q=new A.h5("Disputes & refunds","How problems are reviewed, and what to expect",B.i6,B.a7d)
B.aah=s(["Check the mechanic's name and photo match the profile in the app before they start.","Have another person home if you can, or tell someone you trust that a mechanic is coming.","Stay in a visible, well-lit area and keep valuables put away.","Do not hand over your keys or move the car until you are comfortable with who you are dealing with.","If anything feels wrong, you do not have to continue. See 'I feel unsafe'."],t.s)
B.Xz=new A.ds(B.aah)
B.a9X=s([B.Xz],t.f)
B.Wd=new A.bb("c-safety-meeting","When a mechanic comes to you","Simple habits that keep you safe.",B.a9X)
B.a58=s(["Mechanics bidding on your job see your description, vehicle, photos and zip code.","Your full address is shown only to the mechanic you chose, after payment is secured, and hidden again once the job is done.","Other personal details, such as your name, may stay hidden until the mechanic arrives.","Mechanics agree to use your information only for your job and never to share, post, sell or misuse it."],t.s)
B.XB=new A.ds(B.a58)
B.ZS=new A.b_("If you think your information was misused, tell us right away using 'Report a concern'.")
B.aav=s([B.XB,B.ZS],t.f)
B.WS=new A.bb("c-safety-privacy","Your privacy","What the mechanic can and cannot see.",B.aav)
B.aaE=s(["A request to pay cash, send money by app, or pay anywhere outside YCYC.","A price that changes after you accepted, or pressure to approve extra work on the spot.","Someone who is not the mechanic you chose.","A bid far below every other bid with no explanation. Ask what is and is not included.","Anyone asking for your password, card number or a verification code. YCYC will never ask."],t.s)
B.XL=new A.ds(B.aaE)
B.YA=new A.b_("If you see any of these, decline politely and tell us with 'Report a concern'.")
B.a8e=s([B.XL,B.YA],t.f)
B.We=new A.bb("c-safety-scams","Spotting scams and red flags","Walk away if you see these.",B.a8e)
B.a_G=new A.hE("YCYC is not an emergency service. If you are in danger, or someone is hurt, call 911.")
B.ZJ=new A.b_("After you are safe, report what happened using 'Report a concern' so we can act on it.")
B.a6t=s([B.a_G,B.ZJ],t.f)
B.Wo=new A.bb("c-safety-emergency","Emergencies","Call 911. Then tell us.",B.a6t)
B.a7S=s([B.Wd,B.WS,B.We,B.Wo],t.fm)
B.a_m=new A.h5("Safety & privacy","Staying safe and keeping your information private",B.xY,B.a7S)
B.ZH=new A.b_("YCYC is a neutral platform. We cannot, and do not, recommend or endorse any specific mechanic or shop. Any badge, verification mark or review is information for you to weigh, not a promise about the quality of a repair.")
B.ZC=new A.b_("Every mechanic is an independent business responsible for their own work. The tips below are general guidance only. The final choice is always yours.")
B.a9U=s([B.ZH,B.ZC],t.f)
B.Wv=new A.bb("c-choose-neutral","Your Car, Your Choice: what YCYC can and cannot tell you","We are neutral. We cannot endorse any mechanic or shop.",B.a9U)
B.Y0=new A.wP("Look at the whole picture")
B.aas=s(["Reviews: read several, not just the star average. Look for comments about jobs like yours, honesty, and showing up on time.","Experience: years in the trade and the kind of work they list.","Certifications: ASE certificates that YCYC has reviewed show specific training. They do not guarantee a good result.","Insurance: a mechanic may show an insurance badge. It is information, not a guarantee that any claim will be paid.","Warranty: if a mechanic offers a warranty, ask exactly what it covers and for how long. It is between you and the mechanic.","Mobile or shop: decide whether you want work done at your place or at a shop."],t.s)
B.XK=new A.ds(B.aas)
B.Y_=new A.wP("Compare bids sensibly")
B.a9Z=s(["Compare what each price includes: parts, labor, fluids, taxes.","Be careful with a bid far below the rest. Ask what is and is not included.","Check the arrival day and time fit your schedule."],t.s)
B.Xq=new A.ds(B.a9Z)
B.Y1=new A.wP("Trust your judgment")
B.a7E=s(["If a profile is thin or something feels off, pick another bid. There is no deadline to accept.","Keep everything in the app so you have a record and your payment protection."],t.s)
B.XD=new A.ds(B.a7E)
B.Yl=new A.dV("You can also open 'Tips on choosing the best mechanic for YOU' from the bids screen any time you are comparing bids.")
B.a8o=s([B.Y0,B.XK,B.Y_,B.Xq,B.Y1,B.XD,B.Yl],t.f)
B.Wh=new A.bb("c-choose-tips","Tips for choosing the best mechanic for you","Reviews, credentials, price, timing and communication.",B.a8o)
B.a8z=s(["Verified: YCYC has reviewed the mechanic's details before they could bid. It is not an endorsement of any particular repair.","ASE certified: one or more ASE certificates were uploaded and approved by YCYC. Check which ones.","Insurance: the mechanic uploaded proof of insurance that YCYC reviewed, and it has not expired. It is not a guarantee of coverage for your job.","Mobile service, Shop, Warranty offered, Accepts insurance jobs: what the mechanic says they offer."],t.s)
B.XG=new A.ds(B.a8z)
B.Y9=new A.dV("YCYC reviews documents it is shown. We do not inspect work, and we cannot guarantee any mechanic.")
B.a6o=s([B.XG,B.Y9],t.f)
B.W3=new A.bb("c-choose-badges","What the badges and labels on a profile mean","Information to weigh, not guarantees.",B.a6o)
