B.alM=new A.fA(1,B.y8,"Describe your issue","Tell us what's wrong, or upload a quote you already have. Posting is free and nothing is charged.",!1,null)
B.alN=new A.fA(6,B.i8,"Release payment and review","When you're happy with the work, release payment so your mechanic gets paid, then leave a review.",!0,null)
B.alO=new A.fA(2,B.xO,"Why we exist","Car repair shouldn't be a black box. Too many drivers get overcharged or talked into work they didn't ask for, with nowhere else to turn. YCYC puts that choice back in your hands.",!1,null)
B.alP=new A.fA(1,B.y8,"Describe what's happening","Tell us about the symptoms. The more detail, the better the bids.",!1,null)
B.alQ=new A.fA(3,B.i8,"Get chosen & paid securely","Payment is held in escrow and released to you once the job is done.",!0,null)
B.alR=new A.fA(2,B.i6,"Get competing bids","Local mechanics bid to win your job and we notify you as bids arrive. Only you can see them. You can cancel for free until you accept one.",!1,null)
