B.alU=new A.fA(1,B.fO,"What YCYC is","\"Your Car, Your Choice\" is a marketplace where independent, local mechanics compete for your repair job by bidding on it \u2014 you're never stuck with a single shop's price.",!1,null)
B.alV=new A.fA(5,B.jD,"You get the diagnosis in writing","It shows up in the app, and we let you know.",!1,null)
B.alW=new A.fA(3,B.qx,"Built by a mechanic","YCYC was founded by a former mechanic who has spent years teaching people in underserved neighborhoods how to work on their own cars \u2014 this app runs on that same idea: give people real options and straight answers.",!1,null)
