B.alY=new A.fA(4,B.i8,"How it works","Describe your issue (or upload a quote you already have), get competing bids from real mechanics, and pay securely \u2014 your payment is only released once the work is actually done.",!0,null)
B.alZ=new A.fA(5,B.dz,"Your mechanic arrives","Follow them on the map or ask them to share their location. Your name stays private until they arrive. Confirm when they start. Any extra work needs your approval first.",!1,null)
